.TH std::move_iterator::operator= 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::move_iterator::operator= \- std::move_iterator::operator=

.SH Synopsis
template< class U >                                         (constexpr since C++17)
move_iterator& operator=( const move_iterator<U>& other );

Assigns other.current to current ﻿.

If U is not convertible to Iter, the program is ill-formed.                  \fI(until C++20)\fP
This overload participates in overload resolution only if std::is_same_v<U,
Iter> is false and both std::convertible_to<const U&, Iter> and              \fI(since C++20)\fP
std::assignable_from<Iter&, const U&> are modeled.

.SH Parameters

other - iterator adaptor to assign

.SH Return value

*this

